list.item:
No item in Class 2 should be approved for export to Eastern Europe until
                        it has been reviewed individually, or in a group of cases, by the
                        Subcommittee;

Items in Class 3 should be licensed by OIT within the policy framework,
                        except for special cases which OIT may wish to bring to the attention of the
                            Ad Hoc Subcommittee;
